{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block main %}
<main class="pdf-page protocol-page">
  <section class="content-card protocol-intro" aria-labelledby="protocol-intro-title">
    <h2 id="protocol-intro-title">Protocol</h2>
    <p>
      本页提供 PAGER-Yeast 项目湿实验的完整操作规程手册（Protocol，PDF 共 32 页），
      按项目实验链的四个模块组织：底盘菌株改造、报告体系构建、Gpa1-Gα 人源化，
      以及 PAGER 融合受体相关实验的转化、表达验证与诱导检测。
    </p>
    <p>
      The full wet-lab protocols of the PAGER-Yeast project are provided here as a
      single handbook (PDF, 32 pages), organized into the four modules of the
      experimental pipeline: chassis strain engineering, reporter system construction,
